<mxfile host="aegis" modified="2026-09-02T00:00:00Z" agent="build_arch.py" version="24.7.17"><diagram id="deployed" name="Deployed + validated"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2380" pageHeight="2200" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;AEGIS Governance Platform on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore — as DEPLOYED and LIVE-VALIDATED (2026-09-02)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1500" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Benefits Eligibility pack &lt;b&gt;v0.3.0-pilot-rc1&lt;/b&gt; · governed-core &lt;b&gt;1.7.1&lt;/b&gt; (hash-pinned) · AWS account-agnostic, us-east-1 · Every element is tagged &lt;font color='#1D8102'&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIVE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; (deployed + exercised with real requests; evidence file cited) · &lt;font color='#B7791F'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OFFLINE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; (implemented + unit-tested in platform_core, not wired into a deployed path) · &lt;font color='#8B8B8B'&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOT BUILT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; (design only). Nothing aspirational is drawn as if it existed. Sources: benefits/evidence/AGENTCORE-*-2026-09-02.md, AGENTCORE-111-GATE-2026-09-02.md, EP1-VALIDATION.md; platform DEPLOYED-AND-VALIDATED.md, MATURITY.yaml." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="42" width="2300" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="AWS Cloud — one shared control plane per deployment (hybrid multi-tenant: -c tenants=a,b) or one silo per customer (default)" style="points=[[0,0],[0.25,0],[0.5,0],[0.75,0],[1,0],[1,0.25],[1,0.5],[1,0.75],[1,1],[0.75,1],[0.5,1],[0.25,1],[0,1],[0,0.75],[0,0.5],[0,0.25]];outlineConnect=0;gradientColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;container=1;pointerEvents=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;shape=mxgraph.aws4.group;grIcon=mxgraph.aws4.group_aws_cloud_alt;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;fontColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="100" width="2320" height="1575" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="LAYER 1 · IDENTITY — who is acting.  Protects: every call is bound to a verified human; the tenant is DERIVED from the identity, never typed.  Tracks: sub, groups, tenant, session." style="points=[[0,0],[0.25,0],[0.5,0],[0.75,0],[1,0],[1,0.25],[1,0.5],[1,0.75],[1,1],[0.75,1],[0.5,1],[0.25,1],[0,1],[0,0.75],[0,0.5],[0,0.25]];outlineConnect=0;gradientColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;container=1;pointerEvents=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;shape=mxgraph.aws4.group;grIcon=mxgraph.aws4.group_security_identity_compliance;strokeColor=#DD344C;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;fontColor=#DD344C;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="20" y="40" width="2280" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="Caseworker / Approver (different humans: SoD)" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.user;labelWidth=130;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c14"><mxGeometry x="30" y="42" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="Amazon Cognito user pool — groups benefits_caseworker + tenant_&lt;id&gt;; MFA REQUIRED in pilot mode" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#DD344C;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.cognito;labelWidth=200;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c14"><mxGeometry x="220" y="32" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c14"><mxGeometry x="238" y="150" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;b&gt;JWT flow (SRP → access token)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Human authenticates to Cognito (SRP; MFA in pilot mode) → &lt;b&gt;access token&lt;/b&gt; (RS256, iss / client_id / exp, &lt;code&gt;cognito:groups&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;br&gt;2. The SAME token is (a) the bearer for the AgentCore &lt;b&gt;Runtime&lt;/b&gt; (customJWTAuthorizer: discoveryUrl + allowedClients) and (b) the bearer the runtime forwards to the &lt;b&gt;Gateway&lt;/b&gt; (CUSTOM_JWT) — Cedar evaluates the real human principal, never a service role.&lt;br&gt;3. &lt;code&gt;approve_signoff&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;request_signoff&lt;/code&gt; and multi-tenant &lt;code&gt;ingest&lt;/code&gt; re-verify the token themselves (RS256 vs JWKS, client id, reviewer group) — P0-5: no 'requester' field is ever trusted.&lt;br&gt;4. Tenant = the &lt;code&gt;tenant_&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; group → gateway interceptor → HMAC-signed pair (Layer 3). An un-tenanted identity gets 0 tools + 403 (require_tenant)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c14"><mxGeometry x="480" y="25" width="1100" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c14"><mxGeometry x="1516" y="30" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="&lt;b&gt;Evidence&lt;/b&gt;: cw-a / cw-b / cw-none live runs — AGENTCORE-MULTITENANT-E2E-2026-09-02.md · approval-path verification (a raw send-task-success is refused) — governed-core 1.5.0, DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE · MFA pool ON — EP1-VALIDATION.md" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c14"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="25" width="660" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="LAYER 2 · AGENT RUNTIME + MODEL — the reasoning.  Protects: session isolation, tenant-bound session, guardrailed generation, masked-before-model.  Tracks: every span + every model call, tagged per tenant / session / case." style="points=[[0,0],[0.25,0],[0.5,0],[0.75,0],[1,0],[1,0.25],[1,0.5],[1,0.75],[1,1],[0.75,1],[0.5,1],[0.25,1],[0,1],[0,0.75],[0,0.5],[0,0.25]];outlineConnect=0;gradientColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;container=1;pointerEvents=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;shape=mxgraph.aws4.group;grIcon=mxgraph.aws4.group_ai_ml;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;fontColor=#01A88D;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="20" y="255" width="1120" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="Amazon Bedrock AgentCore RUNTIME — Strands agent, ADOT, microVM per session" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#01A88D;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.bedrock;labelWidth=140;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c21"><mxGeometry x="60" y="65" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c21"><mxGeometry x="60" y="183" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="Amazon Bedrock model — Claude Sonnet 4.5 (ConverseStream)" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#01A88D;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.bedrock;labelWidth=170;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c21"><mxGeometry x="260" y="65" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c21"><mxGeometry x="260" y="183" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="Bedrock Guardrail on draft_notice (-c guardrail_id); intervention ⇒ ManualReview" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#01A88D;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.bedrock;labelWidth=170;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c21"><mxGeometry x="460" y="65" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c21"><mxGeometry x="460" y="183" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;b&gt;What the runtime does on every invocation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• binds &lt;code&gt;session.id&lt;/code&gt; (X-Amzn-Bedrock-AgentCore-Runtime-Session-Id) + derived tenant + case as Strands &lt;code&gt;trace_attributes&lt;/code&gt; and OTEL baggage&lt;br&gt;• injects &lt;code&gt;requestMetadata&lt;/code&gt; {tenant, session_id, case_id, requester} on EVERY Converse call → model-invocation log rows are per-tenant filterable&lt;br&gt;• MULTITENANT=1: refuses an identity with no tenant; the human's JWT is the bearer for every gateway tool call&lt;br&gt;• never commits: consequential actions end at the human sign-off gate (Cedar forbids finalize / refer_fraud to the agent)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c21"><mxGeometry x="650" y="20" width="450" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="&lt;b&gt;Evidence&lt;/b&gt;: real Runtime, 2 tenants, 13/13 checks each — AGENTCORE-OBSERVABILITY-2026-09-02.md; repeated on the release tag — AGENTCORE-111-GATE-2026-09-02.md; masked_before_model = true on every model invocation. Guardrail G1 wired + validated 2026-08-29 (ben-demo); the multi-tenant runs used the sandbox (unguarded) switch." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c21"><mxGeometry x="650" y="190" width="450" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="&lt;b&gt;TOKEN BUDGETS / COST CEILING — honest status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1D8102'&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIVE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; tracked: inputTokenCount / outputTokenCount per invocation (model log) + gen_ai.usage on every span, tagged per tenant / session / case.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#B7791F'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OFFLINE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; capped: platform_core/token_budget.py hard/soft meter (preflight denies) + manifest &lt;code&gt;budget:&lt;/code&gt; 5M tokens/month hard — read by NO deployed component today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8B8B8B'&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOT BUILT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: AWS Budgets $ ceiling with an action → kill switch; per-tenant live meter. Design + build list B1–B5: docs/TOKEN-BUDGETS-AND-COST-CEILINGS.md" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E7;strokeColor=#B7791F;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c21"><mxGeometry x="30" y="207" width="600" height="113" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="LAYER 3 · GOVERNED TOOL GATEWAY — every tool call is authorized.  Protects: deny-by-default, mask-before-use, no self-commit, tenant scope.  Tracks: every request row (initialize / tools/list / tools/call) with trace + request ids." style="points=[[0,0],[0.25,0],[0.5,0],[0.75,0],[1,0],[1,0.25],[1,0.5],[1,0.75],[1,1],[0.75,1],[0.5,1],[0.25,1],[0,1],[0,0.75],[0,0.5],[0,0.25]];outlineConnect=0;gradientColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;container=1;pointerEvents=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;shape=mxgraph.aws4.group;grIcon=mxgraph.aws4.group_security_identity_compliance;strokeColor=#DD344C;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;fontColor=#DD344C;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="255" width="1140" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="AgentCore GATEWAY (MCP, CUSTOM_JWT) — 10 tools over 8 Lambda targets" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#01A88D;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.bedrock;labelWidth=170;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c31"><mxGeometry x="550" y="65" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c31"><mxGeometry x="550" y="183" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="AgentCore POLICY engine — Cedar, ENFORCE (AWS preview); platform_core engine = fail-closed oracle" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#DD344C;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.identity_and_access_management;labelWidth=170;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c31"><mxGeometry x="760" y="65" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c31"><mxGeometry x="760" y="183" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="REQUEST interceptor (Lambda) — after auth, before the target" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=170;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c31"><mxGeometry x="970" y="65" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c31"><mxGeometry x="970" y="183" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="&lt;b&gt;Cedar policies (deny-by-default)&lt;/b&gt;: caseworker_permit · mask_before_assess / redetermine / overpayment / draft (forbid unless deidentified) · no_self_commit · no_self_fraud_referral · require_tenant (multi-tenant only).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Interceptor on every tools/call&lt;/b&gt;: derives the tenant from the validated JWT → injects &lt;code&gt;__aegis_tenant&lt;/code&gt; + HMAC &lt;code&gt;__aegis_tenant_sig&lt;/code&gt; (per-deploy Secrets Manager key) + &lt;code&gt;__aegis_trace&lt;/code&gt; {trace_id, span_id, session_id, case_id} from the MCP _meta context; un-tenanted ⇒ 403 verbatim. Caller-supplied values are overwritten; targets trust ONLY a verifying signature." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c31"><mxGeometry x="30" y="40" width="480" height="115" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c39" value="&lt;b&gt;Evidence&lt;/b&gt;: ENFORCE from zero — AGENTCORE-E2E-FROMZERO-2026-09-02.md · cross-tenant deny (cw-none: 0 tools, 403) — AGENTCORE-MULTITENANT-E2E · 33 gateway request rows per session joined by trace id — AGENTCORE-OBSERVABILITY · red-team + 29-check demo (legacy shell path) — README." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c31"><mxGeometry x="550" y="207" width="360" height="113" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="&lt;b&gt;KILL SWITCH — where you can stop it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1D8102'&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIVE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; platform reference gateway (aegis-governance-core): SSM &lt;code&gt;/aegis/kill-switch&lt;/code&gt; read FIRST, 15 s TTL, fail-closed if unreadable, every denial audited; engage-only / disengage-only IAM policies (SoD). Validated: engaged → 403 (DEPLOYED-AND-VALIDATED Run 11).&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8B8B8B'&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOT WIRED&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; in this AgentCore path yet. Fast stops available today (manual, CloudTrail-logged, seconds): A1 Cedar forbid-all policy · A2 delete gateway targets · A3 disable the runtime · A4 Lambda concurrency 0 · A5 IAM deny InvokeModel. Build = interceptor + tool Lambdas + runtime check, WORM-audited (docs/ops/KILL-SWITCH.md)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDECEC;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c31"><mxGeometry x="30" y="165" width="480" height="155" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="LAYER 4 · GOVERNED TOOLS — one Lambda per manifest target, least-privilege IAM, X-Ray.  Protects: fail-closed masking, signed de-identification proof, pass-by-reference, exactly-once commit.  Tracks: one structured aegis.call line per invocation (keys, outcome, arg digest — never values)." style="points=[[0,0],[0.25,0],[0.5,0],[0.75,0],[1,0],[1,0.25],[1,0.5],[1,0.75],[1,1],[0.75,1],[0.5,1],[0.25,1],[0,1],[0,0.75],[0,0.5],[0,0.25]];outlineConnect=0;gradientColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;container=1;pointerEvents=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;shape=mxgraph.aws4.group;grIcon=mxgraph.aws4.group_compute;strokeColor=#ED7100;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;fontColor=#ED7100;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="20" y="630" width="2280" height="270" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="ingest-application" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="30" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c43" value="intake-application" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="148" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c44" value="mask-pii" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="266" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c45" value="assess-eligibility" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="384" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="redetermine" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="502" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c47" value="overpayment" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="620" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c48" value="ben-core" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="738" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c49" value="write-audit" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="856" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c50" value="request-signoff" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="974" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c51" value="signoff-register" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="1092" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c52" value="finalize" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c53" value="approve-signoff" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="1328" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c54" value="workflow-guards" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="1446" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c55" value="tenant-interceptor" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;labelWidth=110;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="1564" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c56" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="30" y="120" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c57" value="Amazon Comprehend DetectPiiEntities" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#01A88D;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.comprehend;labelWidth=120;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="1740" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c58" value="Secrets Manager — per-deploy HMAC key (sanitized_ref + tenant pair)" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#DD344C;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.secrets_manager;labelWidth=150;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="1890" y="45" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c59" value="&lt;b&gt;Roles&lt;/b&gt;: ingest = the only door for raw content (R3-2; multi-tenant: token-verified tenant) · intake = decision fields · mask_pii → Comprehend, mints the signed sanitized_ref · assess / redetermine / overpayment = deterministic rules (FPL-pinned; due-process classification) · ben-core = draft_notice (guardrailed) / finalize / refer_fraud (Cedar-forbidden to the agent) · write_audit = canonical evidence · request_signoff / signoff_register / approve_signoff / finalize = the SoD sign-off gate · workflow_guards = state-transition guards · tenant-interceptor = Layer 3." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="30" y="145" width="1100" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c60" value="&lt;b&gt;Controls in code&lt;/b&gt; (governed-core 1.7.1 = the shared, hash-pinned control plane; benefits overrides mask_pii + provenance, declared): fail-closed masking (no proof ⇒ refuse) · sanitized_ref HMAC bound to content + tenant · R3-2 pass-by-reference (raw text never in workflow state; strict PII canary PASS) · evidence.record_event hash chain + WORM copy + correlation block · finalize FINAL# exactly-once + approval-path verification · tenancy.route_store to the tenant's physical stores, fail-closed · telemetry.instrument = one aegis.call line per call." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="145" width="700" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c61" value="&lt;b&gt;Evidence&lt;/b&gt;: EP1-VALIDATION.md (canary 0 leaks, AdverseNoticeHold) · AGENTCORE-MULTITENANT-AUDIT (routing 12/12) · 111 gate (0 unexpected errors, 20 log groups) · governed-core tests + 46-file lock." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c41"><mxGeometry x="1870" y="145" width="390" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c62" value="LAYER 5 · DETERMINISTIC WORKFLOW — the human gate.  Protects: the model cannot skip a guard or commit; adverse actions hold for due-process notice.  Tracks: every state with the execution ARN; execution data OFF (refs only)." style="points=[[0,0],[0.25,0],[0.5,0],[0.75,0],[1,0],[1,0.25],[1,0.5],[1,0.75],[1,1],[0.75,1],[0.5,1],[0.25,1],[0,1],[0,0.75],[0,0.5],[0,0.25]];outlineConnect=0;gradientColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;container=1;pointerEvents=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;shape=mxgraph.aws4.group;grIcon=mxgraph.aws4.group_application_integration;strokeColor=#E7157B;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;fontColor=#E7157B;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="20" y="960" width="1120" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c63" value="AWS Step Functions controller — X-Ray on, execution logging without data" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#E7157B;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.step_functions;labelWidth=150;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c62"><mxGeometry x="60" y="50" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c64" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c62"><mxGeometry x="60" y="168" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c65" value="Extract → GuardExtracted → MaskPii → GuardDeidentified → AssessEligibility → GuardRulesExecuted → CheckAdverseNotice (&lt;b&gt;AdverseNoticeHold&lt;/b&gt; = terminal due-process hold) → DraftNotice → &lt;b&gt;DraftOk&lt;/b&gt; (guardrail-blocked ⇒ ManualReview) → AuditIntent → &lt;b&gt;HumanSignoff&lt;/b&gt; (waitForTaskToken, 24 h) → Finalize → &lt;b&gt;FinalizeOk&lt;/b&gt; (refused ⇒ ManualReview) → Committed.&lt;br&gt;Every Lambda payload carries &lt;code&gt;__aegis_execution&lt;/code&gt; = $$.Execution.Id; multi-tenant payloads carry the signed tenant pair — an execution started without it FAILS at the first state (fail-closed, proven)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c62"><mxGeometry x="240" y="35" width="860" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c66" value="&lt;b&gt;Evidence&lt;/b&gt;: EP1-VALIDATION.md · DEMO-DEPLOY-2026-08-24.md · AGENTCORE-MULTITENANT-AUDIT (workflow hop with / without the pair) · 111 gate." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c62"><mxGeometry x="240" y="170" width="860" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c67" value="LAYER 6 · PER-TENANT DATA + WORM EVIDENCE — physically separate per tenant.  Protects: isolation, tamper-evidence, retention.  Tracks: hash-chained ledger rows (correlation keys hashed), Object-Lock copies, CloudTrail data events." style="points=[[0,0],[0.25,0],[0.5,0],[0.75,0],[1,0],[1,0.25],[1,0.5],[1,0.75],[1,1],[0.75,1],[0.5,1],[0.25,1],[0,1],[0,0.75],[0,0.5],[0,0.25]];outlineConnect=0;gradientColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;container=1;pointerEvents=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;shape=mxgraph.aws4.group;grIcon=mxgraph.aws4.group_storage;strokeColor=#7AA116;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;fontColor=#7AA116;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="960" width="1140" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c68" value="DynamoDB per tenant — case-store · sanitized-artifacts · audit-ledger (hash chain, PITR) · pending-approvals" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#C925D1;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.dynamodb;labelWidth=190;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c67"><mxGeometry x="70" y="50" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c69" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c67"><mxGeometry x="70" y="168" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c70" value="S3 Object Lock WORM vault per tenant — &amp;lt;prefix&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;tenant&amp;gt;-worm-&amp;lt;acct&amp;gt;" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#7AA116;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.s3;labelWidth=170;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c67"><mxGeometry x="290" y="50" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c71" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c67"><mxGeometry x="290" y="168" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c72" value="AWS KMS CMK (-c kms=customer-managed)" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#DD344C;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.key_management_service;labelWidth=150;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c67"><mxGeometry x="500" y="50" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c73" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c67"><mxGeometry x="500" y="168" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c74" value="Base silo stack + ONE DataStack per tenant (&lt;code&gt;-c tenants=pha-a,pha-b&lt;/code&gt;). Mirror IAM grants scoped to &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;prefix&amp;gt;-*-&amp;lt;logical&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;; the audit writer has an explicit DENY on Update / Delete / retention bypass. Retention: GOVERNANCE 1d sandbox → COMPLIANCE 7y production-reference.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Proven&lt;/b&gt;: base ledger + base vault received 0 writes across whole runs; the other tenant's ledger was empty for every case (MULTITENANT-AUDIT 12/12; 111 gate). EP1 Gate-B switches (CMK, zero egress, MFA) validated 2026-07-27 on v0.1.2-pilot-rc1 — not re-walked on this tag." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c67"><mxGeometry x="650" y="30" width="470" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c75" value="LAYER 7 · TRANSPARENCY — every API call, the model's reasoning and the evidence, joined by ONE correlation set (tenant · session · trace · request · case).  Protects: auditability, per-tenant filtering, masked-before-model measured." style="points=[[0,0],[0.25,0],[0.5,0],[0.75,0],[1,0],[1,0.25],[1,0.5],[1,0.75],[1,1],[0.75,1],[0.5,1],[0.25,1],[0,1],[0,0.75],[0,0.5],[0,0.25]];outlineConnect=0;gradientColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;container=1;pointerEvents=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;shape=mxgraph.aws4.group;grIcon=mxgraph.aws4.group_management_governance;strokeColor=#E7157B;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;fontColor=#E7157B;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1255" width="2280" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c76" value="CloudWatch Logs — Lambda · Step Functions · gateway vended request log · runtime logs" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#E7157B;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.cloudwatch;labelWidth=150;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c75"><mxGeometry x="60" y="50" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c77" value="X-Ray + Transaction Search — aws/spans: agent, model, tool + Lambda segments under ONE trace id" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#E7157B;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.xray;labelWidth=190;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c75"><mxGeometry x="260" y="50" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c78" value="Bedrock model-invocation log (-c model_logging=1) — exact bodies, requestMetadata per tenant / session" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#01A88D;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.bedrock;labelWidth=190;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c75"><mxGeometry x="500" y="50" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c79" value="CloudTrail data events on the WORM vault" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#E7157B;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.cloudtrail;labelWidth=150;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c75"><mxGeometry x="740" y="50" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c80" value="Dashboard + alarms → SNS (workflow failed / timed out, guard failures, governance Lambda errors)" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#E7157B;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.cloudwatch;labelWidth=190;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c75"><mxGeometry x="940" y="50" width="64" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c81" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c75"><mxGeometry x="60" y="170" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c82" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c75"><mxGeometry x="260" y="170" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c83" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c75"><mxGeometry x="500" y="170" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c84" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c75"><mxGeometry x="740" y="170" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c85" value="LIVE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1D8102;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="c75"><mxGeometry x="940" y="170" width="64" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c86" value="&lt;b&gt;trace_case.py&lt;/b&gt; — one auditor timeline per case: WORM rows → correlation keys → runtime spans + reasoning events (session.id) → gateway rows (trace id) → Lambda aegis.call lines → model-invocation rows (requestMetadata.case_id; requestId = the span's aws.request_id) → Step Functions history; verdict per tenant incl. &lt;b&gt;masked_before_model&lt;/b&gt; against PII canaries.&lt;br&gt;Live: 1 agent / 10–14 model / 12 tool spans, 33 gateway rows, 7 Lambda calls, 5–7 model invocations per tenant — all joined; the other tenant's timeline empty." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c75"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="35" width="720" hei